      <h2>Checkpoints and reports</h2>
      <p><strong>Year 6 Checkpoint.</strong> Optional. A Cambridge diagnostic test in English, Maths and Science at the end of Primary. It gives a clear picture of strengths and gaps, and practice at sitting a formal exam.</p>
      <p><strong>Reports and meetings.</strong> Written progress reports, plus parent and teacher meetings in October and March. In between, just ask.</p>
